 dashed line is the time-activity curve of renalpelvis, and the asterisks show the point we fitted.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJBI2007-63234.004" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="T1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Parameters of the kidney model.</p></caption><table><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>k</italic><sub>1</sub>(min<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>k</italic><sub>2</sub>(min<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>f</italic><sub>1</sub></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>f</italic><sub>2</sub></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subject1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.4659</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.8042</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.15964</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.07574</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subject2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.8423</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.3827</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.03293</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.10977</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subject3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.3318</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.9806</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.19699</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.04073</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subject4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.7703</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.8280</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.17543</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.03623</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subject5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.5503</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" cols